{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27633","headline":"送王昌涉侍御 · 张祜","name":"送王昌涉侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十里指东平，军前首出征。\n诸侯青服旧，御史紫衣荣。\n入陈枭心死，分围虎力生。\n画时安楚塞，刻日下齐城。\n号令朝移幕，偷踪夜斫营。\n云梯曾险上，地道惯深行。\n举斾招降将，投戈趁败兵。\n自慙居虏者，当此立功名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27633.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27633","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}